  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Inspire International is a health and wellness brand dedicated to making advanced nutrition simple and accessible. We offer LifeBeat®, a liquid longevity formula packed with 65+ nutrients designed to support energy, vitality, and long-term wellness, and NITROX3®, an oral dissolve strip that supports nitric oxide for circulation and performance. Everything we create is built around one belief: that living well shouldn't be complicated. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>What makes us different: </strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">We don't believe in filler ingredients or empty promises. Every product in our lineup is formulated with purpose — combining science-backed nutrients in forms your body can actually absorb and use. We're not just selling supplements; we're building a community of health-conscious individuals who want to feel better, live longer, and show up fully in their lives. How affiliates can earn: Affiliates earn a 20% commission on every sale made through their unique link or discount code. Our 30-day cookie window ensures you get credit even if your audience doesn't purchase on their first visit. Commissions are tracked in real time and paid out monthly. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>How to promote us: </strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Share your honest experience with our products through your content — whether that's a daily routine, a testimonial, an unboxing, or educational posts about ingredients and wellness. Your audience trusts you, and we want them to discover us through that trust. We provide ready-to-use product photos, brand assets, and a Brand Guide to keep your content aligned and on point. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>Other information: </strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Your followers receive 10% off their first purchase through your exclusive discount code — making it easier for them to say yes and for you to convert. We're looking for creators who genuinely align with a health-forward lifestyle and want to be part of something bigger than an affiliate program.</p></div></div>",
